# INVWINPA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: an item's parts
# and the assembly commands at level 3.  Record > Parts shows item 1's
# parts, none.  INS asks for a part: 9, no item's ID, is
# looked for as text and found in none, the list empty, and item 1 is
# refused as holding itself, each in the dialog, which stays; item 3 is
# installed, and Install part installs item 2 the same way, the list
# fetched again showing both at item 1's location.  ESC goes back to the
# item list.  There Install in on item 3 asks for the item to install it
# in: item 3 itself is refused, the focus on its ID, and item 2, chosen by
# its maker from the pick list that F4 shows, takes it, so item 1's parts
# show item 3 indented below item 2, where DOWN selects it.  Install in on
# item 2 into item 3 is refused as a cycle, and into item 1, which holds
# it already, changes nothing.  Move and Take out start on the item's
# location, a part's being its assembly's.  Move on item 2, a part, is
# refused as installed, and the dialog, its location changed, left after
# a question; on item 1 it opens on Office, its pick list too, and Office
# kept sends nothing and notes nothing; then it moves the whole assembly
# to B2, a location refused first as unknown, the focus on it.  Take out
# on item 1 is refused as not installed; on item 2 it takes it out, with
# its own part, to A1.  In item 1's parts, empty again, Install part
# installs item 2 back, Take out on its part 3 takes that out to B2, and
# ENTER shows item 2 in the item form, which ESC closes; ESC goes back to
# the item list; the end by Exit.  Each command is a Record entry (ALT-C).
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPA.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-C P
S EMPTY
K INS
S ASKPART
T 9
K ENTER
S NOITEM
K ESC
T 1
K ENTER
S SELF
# the ID, selected, typed over
K SHIFT-HOME
T 3
K ENTER
S ONE
K ALT-C I
T 2
K ENTER
S TWO
K ESC
S ITEMS
K DOWN DOWN ALT-C I
S ASKIN
T 3
K ENTER
S INSELF
T Tandon
K F4
S PICKIN
K ENTER ENTER
K HOME ALT-C P
S TREE
K DOWN
S TREEDN
K ESC DOWN ALT-C I
T 3
K ENTER
S CYCLE
T 1
K ENTER
S SAME
K ALT-C M
S ASKMOVE
T B2
K ENTER
S INST
K ESC Y
S NOMOVE
K UP ALT-C M
S ATHOME
K F4
S PICKHOME
K ENTER ENTER
S SAMEOFF
K ALT-C M
T ZZ
K ENTER
S NOLOC
T B2
K ENTER
S MOVED
K ALT-C T
S ASKOUT
T A1
K ENTER
S NOTIN
K ESC Y DOWN ALT-C T
T A1
K ENTER
S OUT
K UP ALT-C P
S NONE
K ALT-C I
T 2
K ENTER
S BACKIN
K DOWN ALT-C T
T B2
K ENTER
S PARTOUT
# ENTER shows the part in the item form, which ESC closes: the parts
# stay, and their Updated date, the day of the run, is in no snapshot
K ENTER ESC
S VIEWED
K ESC
S END
K ALT-F X
